## TS Apps on Workspaces


```
curl https://mise.run | sh
eval "$(mise activate bash)"
mise use --global bun@latest
```

Then, in the folder of the app:

```
bun install
bun run dev
```

If there's a node error still:
```
mise use --global node@latest
```

Then on the Vite side to redirect in the webapp:
https://github.com/nimbus-labs/ds-grocer-recommender/blob/rec_app/modules/recommender_app/frontend/vite.config.ts

